   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there a way to make both the bar and the text bigger font. I can get it to be red but the rest doesn&#39;t seem to work:<br><br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bar </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>background</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#FF0000;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">opacity </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Thanks!<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
