ogress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Thanks!<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
