    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br><br>On Wednesday, March 18, 2015 at 6:57:34 PM UTC-7, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Equal signs should be colons, opacity shouldn&#39;t have a leading dot.</p>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mar 18, 2015 5:39 PM, &quot;Greg&quot; &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">gry...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br type=\"attribution\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Joe,<br><br>Thanks -- this kind of works. However, the box doesn&#39;t \r\nscale with the font. This means that I get some bad wrapping. Is it \r\npossible to make the blue background of the progress window wider?<br><br>Also, can I make the actual bar larger?<br><br>I&#39;ve tried this to make the bar larger but without success:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bar </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>background</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#FF0000;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">opacity </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">30px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">detail</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><br>On Wednesday, March 18, 2015 at 9:42:12 AM UTC-7, Greg wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div d