 style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Thanks!<br></div></blockquote></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8ac62db7-8df9-47f6-885b-1dc9c4a230d5%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8ac62db7-8df9-47f6-885b-1dc9c4a230d5%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399712113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-V4o2w_bF9b1H1aSeoMDU\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/8ac62db7-8df9-47f6-885b-1dc9c4a230d5%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399712113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sjChXYYU5DiMIeJDZk12Q\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
